      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DAPHNE ZACAPA (1) has missed the placings at her last couple but was in the money three back when second (23.24) at this track in a Grade 5. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. AT THE GATE (2) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Kicker Zoom (22.96) in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to give a sight. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and a minor placing from six starts. Can measure up. BELTONE BOY (4) was below best last time when fourth at this track but prior to that among the placings in quick time (22.90) at this track. Expecting sharp improvement this line-up. PRINCE VINNIE (3) is very honest and looms as a strong top-three hope again.",
